abstract: "SHTA is a training-time semantic branch for semi-supervised 3D medical image segmentation. It performs Semantic Assignment, Hard Token Refinement, and Semantic Center Alignment to improve semantic consistency in hard regions without adding inference-time overhead. Accepted at IEEE BIBM 2026."
keywords:
  - semi-supervised learning
  - medical image segmentation
  - semantic representation learning
  - hard-token correction
  - center alignment
